  messages:
  - text: RELEASE ME RELEASE ME
    weight: 5
  - text: I want to sleep
    weight: 5
  - text: You can find chests scattered about
    weight: 5
  - text: Rooms contain good loot, but also how to get inside?
    weight: 5
  - text: My nose`s itchin
    weight: 5
  - text: Someone broke their nose off the wall
    weight: 5
  - text: Chests give cards! You may even get someting special...
    weight: 5
  - text: There are 3 upgrades you can get from the booster packs
    weight: 5
  - text: Why do I fell lost...
    weight: 5
  - text: Progress requires sacrifice
    weight: 5
  - text: Cooperate or clash with other players to reach the goal
    weight: 5
  - text: Also try UNO
    weight: 5
  - text: Also try MInecraft
    weight: 5
  - text: Also try Terraria
    weight: 5
  - text: Did you know fishes made this game?
    weight: 5
  - text: Developers take payments in shawarmas
    weight: 5
